m/repos/apache/airflow/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/deployments","created_at":"2015-04-13T18:04:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:15Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-29T14:43:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/apache/airflow.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:apache/airflow.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow","homepage":"https://airflow.apache.org/","size":790917,"stargazers_count":47308,"watchers_count":47308,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":18214,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/73389","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73389","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73389.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73389.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Description\nFixes an issue where `newer_than` comparisons in `SFTPSensor` and `SFTPTrigger` produced incorrect results when the host process timezone differed from Airflow's `core.default_timezone`.\n\n#### Problem & Root Cause\nRemote SFTP modification times (`st_mtime`) represent POSIX epoch seconds (UTC). `SFTPHook.get_mod_time()` and `SFTPHookAsync.get_mod_time()` previously converted this timestamp using naive `datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp()`, returning a local-time string. Downstream consumers (`SFTPSensor` and `SFTPHookAsync._mod_time_to_utc`) parsed that string and passed it to `timezone.convert_to_utc()`, which assumed the timestamp was expressed in `core.default_timezone`.\n\nWhen the host process timezone differed from `core.default_timezone` (for example, a machine in `Asia/Kolkata` or `America/New_York` with Airflow configured for UTC), the modification time was offset by the delta between the two timezones, causing valid files to be ignored or old files to be prematurely accepted.\n\n#### Solution\n1. **`SFTPHook.get_mod_time` & `SFTPHookAsync.get_mod_time`**: Now convert epoch seconds to UTC explicitly via `datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp(..., tz=datetime.UTC).strftime(\"%Y%m%d%H%M%S\")`.\n2. **`SFTPHookAsync._mod_time_to_utc`**: Directly treats strings and epoch values as UTC (`.replace(tzinfo=datetime.UTC)` and `fromtimestamp(..., tz=datetime.UTC)`), without going through `timezone.convert_to_utc`.\n3. **`SFTPSensor`**: Directly attaches `timezone.utc` to the parsed modification time string before comparison.\n4. **`SFTPTrigger`**: Left unchanged from `main`. Following #72336, `SFTPTrigger` delegates all path sensing and date comparisons directly to `SFTPHookAsync.sense_path` and `SFTPHookAsync.sense_files_by_pattern`.\n5. **Cleanups**: Removed dead `timezone` import in `hooks/sftp.py`.\n\n#### Behavior Change\n`SFTPHook.get_mod_time()` and `SFTPHookAsync.get_mod_time()` now return the modification timestamp formatted in UTC (matching FTP MDTM RFC 3659 convention). Any custom user code consuming `get_mod_time()` directly should treat the returned timestamp as UTC. Documented in `providers/sftp/docs/changelog.rst`.\n\n#### Related Issues\n- closes: #73382\n- supersedes #73386\n\n#### Tests\n- Parameterized hook, sensor, and trigger test suites across `UTC` and `America/New_York` process timezones (`time.tzset()`) and Airflow default timezones.\n- Verified that `newer_than` boundaries evaluate consistently regardless of timezone configuration.\n- Replaced legacy naive datetime mocks with UTC-aware datetime objects in trigger tests.\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [ ] Yes (please specify the tool below)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
